{"product_id":"letters-to-felice","title":"Letters to Felice","description":"\u003cp\u003eKafka's letters to Felice Bauer were written between 1912 and 1917, during which time they were twice engaged to be married. This complex relationship, which coincided with a period of great productivity for Kafka, gave him both hope and strength, but gradually disllusionment and the onset of illness drove them apart. These letters remain as a monument to the inner life of a creative artist.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Franz Kafka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749399481\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 604\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885674324121,"sku":"14RA9780749399481","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691458bf0e36d_Letters_to_Felice.jpg?v=1762964619","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/letters-to-felice","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}